#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:6
#: 2de120033f7a4a0da9f596f325984853
msgid "Script Setup and Use Examples"
msgstr "脚本设置和使用示例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:9
#: 018e27566d7340a28423a19001609bd2
msgid "Testing a Script in SITL"
msgstr "在SITL中测试脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:10
#: 1285490aab6b4757a1f4952b76a92803
msgid "In Linux:"
msgstr "在Linux中："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:12
#: 0fb6acc48cb04d749f6b353557cd1198
msgid ""
"Assuming you have setup the build and simulation environment, run the "
"simulation. See :ref:`using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing`. For example:"
msgstr "假设您已设置好构建和仿真环境，运行仿真。参见 :ref:`using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing`。例如："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:18
#: 446ace081210483f83196bbac2405add
msgid ""
"Mavproxy ground control station will automatically be started. You can also "
"start QGC (using the QGroundControl.AppImage) and/or Mission Planner (using "
"WISE to run under Linux). Any or all three can be used simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy地面站将自动启动。您也可以启动QGC（使用QGroundControl.AppImage）和/或Mission "
"Planner（使用WISE在Linux下运行）。三者可同时使用任意组合。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:20
#: 779ee88882ca49a79a0a22ce8cdf4a0c
msgid ""
"From your GCS, enable scripting by setting the :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>`"
" parameter to \"1\". Restart the simulation."
msgstr "在GCS中，通过将 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` 参数设置为「1」来启用脚本功能。重启仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:21
#: e9a93def4fe340cbbc4dd87ab2a59f11
msgid ""
"A \"scripts\" sub-directory will be created in the directory you started the"
" simulation, if it did not already exist. Place the script you downloaded "
"into this directory. Again, restart the simulation."
msgstr "如果启动仿真的目录中不存在「scripts」子目录，将自动创建。将下载的脚本放入该目录。再次重启仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:22
#: b5ff17be303e498eaa99c64f454c78bf
msgid ""
"If you get a \"Scripting: out of memory\" GCS message then you will need to "
"increase :ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` parameter and try to restart "
"the simulation."
msgstr ""
"如果收到「Scripting: out of memory」（脚本：内存不足）GCS消息，需要增大 "
":ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` 参数并尝试重启仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:24
#: b0c0f0309060492787e0463a23145aef
msgid "In Mission Planner (Windows):"
msgstr "在Mission Planner（Windows）中："

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:26
#: e95ad0880e304c8e9420ccc18de79cd1
msgid ""
"Start the simulation in Mission Planner as normal (see :ref:`mission-"
"planner-simulation`)"
msgstr "按常规方式在Mission Planner中启动仿真（参见 :ref:`mission-planner-simulation`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:27
#: e2d7b5d352a44eea87dddd961c64bae3
msgid ""
"In the CONFIG->Full Parameter List, set the :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` "
"parameter to \"1\". Restart the simulation."
msgstr ""
"在CONFIG->Full Parameter List中，将 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` 参数设置为「1」。重启仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:28
#: 129d35773be8488e8ae3b90ad7069290
msgid ""
"The 'scripts' subdirectory will be located in your Documents->Mission "
"Planner->sitl directory.Place the script you downloaded into this directory."
" Again, restart the simulation."
msgstr ""
"'scripts'子目录将位于您的Documents->Mission Planner->sitl目录中。将下载的脚本放入该目录。再次重启仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:29
#: cd5919086ea547ec814965786a3fd38a
msgid ""
"If you get a \"Scripting: out of memory\" GCS message then you will need to "
"increase the :ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` parameter and try to "
"restart the simulation."
msgstr ""
"如果收到「Scripting: out of memory」GCS消息，需要增大 :ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>`"
" 参数并尝试重启仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:32
#: 32bafd725af34ee996e91fabae3697ea
msgid "Running a script on your Autopilot"
msgstr "在飞控上运行脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:34
#: 9e30bc58f84e4c2a8da091fb051f91be
msgid ""
"Connect your GCS and navigate to its parameters screen (CONFIG->Full "
"Parameter List in Mission Planner, Vehicle Setup->Parmeters in QGC) . Enable"
" :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` =1. Disconnect and reconnect the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"连接GCS并导航到其参数界面（Mission Planner中的CONFIG->Full Parameter List，QGC中的Vehicle "
"Setup->Parameters）。启用 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` =1。断开并重新连接飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:35
#: ee60250a899e456ba1dc56c7b4b5203b
msgid ""
"On your SD card, place the script in the APM/scripts directory. This "
"directory will be created on the SD card when you have enabled the "
":ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` via your GCS. If it does not exist, create it "
"and load the script. You can use Mission Planner's CONFIG->MAVFTP tab or "
"take out the SD card and use a PC to write the script onto the card."
msgstr ""
"在SD卡上，将脚本放入APM/scripts目录。通过GCS启用 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE<SCR_ENABLE>` "
"后，该目录将在SD卡上自动创建。如果不存在，请手动创建并加载脚本。您可以使用Mission "
"Planner的CONFIG->MAVFTP标签，或取出SD卡并用PC将脚本写入卡中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:36
#: 498e618619c148f09f0168dd753a763a
msgid ""
"Restart the autopilot with the SD card in and the script(s) on it will load "
"and execute."
msgstr "插入SD卡并装有脚本后重启飞控，脚本将加载并执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:37
#: 8ff1e59eb06246e78458d5bde3e85094
msgid ""
"If you get a \"Scripting: out of memory\" GCS message then you will need to "
"increase :ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>` parameter and try to restart "
"the simulation. How much memory is needed is dependent on the script and the"
" configuration of peripherals and features in use on the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"如果收到「Scripting: out of memory」GCS消息，需要增大 :ref:`SCR_HEAP_SIZE<SCR_HEAP_SIZE>`"
" 参数并尝试重启仿真。所需内存量取决于脚本以及飞控上使用的外设和功能的配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:40
#: dad92e3b19b5417ab07ff09733cd2690
msgid "Once Script is running"
msgstr "脚本运行后"

#: ../../source/docs/common-scripting-step-by-step.rst:42
#: cbba1d31596c4244936dd8627d7cf12e
msgid ""
"Many scripts will require parameters created by the script to be setup or RC"
" switches configured. This should be explained in the script's README.md "
"file co-located with the script in the ArduPilot repo."
msgstr "许多脚本需要配置脚本创建的参数或RC开关。这些应在ArduPilot代码库中与脚本同位置的README.md文件中有说明。"
